user_template:
Extract structured evidence from this instructor debrief narrative.

CONTEXT (for orientation only; do not invent facts from context):
- sample_stratum: {{sample_stratum}}
- program: {{program_name}}
- curriculum_version: {{version_code}}
- mission: {{mission_code}} {{mission_name}}
- mission_role: {{mission_role}}
- session_date: {{session_date}}
- structured_session_grade: {{grading_raw}} (color={{grading_color}}, completion={{grading_completion}})
- exercises_below_required: {{exercises_below_required}}
- mission_attempt_number: {{mission_attempt_number}}

NARRATIVE:
"""
{{narrative_text}}
"""

Return JSON with:
- overall_narrative_tone: POSITIVE | NEUTRAL | CRITICAL | MIXED
- observations: array of {evidence_span, polarity: POSITIVE|DEFICIENCY|NEUTRAL_CONTEXT, interpretation, dimensions: array from candidate list, severity: LOW|MEDIUM|HIGH|UNKNOWN, confidence: HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW}
- assistance_level: NONE_OBSERVED|VERBAL_CONFIRMATION_ONLY|MINOR_PROMPT|REPEATED_PROMPTS|STEP_BY_STEP_COACHING|INSTRUCTOR_DEMONSTRATION|PHYSICAL_INTERVENTION|TAKEOVER_OR_SAFETY_INTERVENTION|UNKNOWN
- assistance_reason, assistance_context, assistance_improved_after: YES|NO|PARTIAL|UNKNOWN|NOT_APPLICABLE
- consistency_class: CONSISTENT|MOSTLY_CONSISTENT|VARIABLE|INCONSISTENT|INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE
- learning_response: RAPID_IMPROVEMENT|IMPROVEMENT|LIMITED_IMPROVEMENT|NO_IMPROVEMENT|REGRESSION_WITHIN_SESSION|UNKNOWN
- accuracy_quality: WITHIN_STANDARD|MINOR_DEVIATION|MATERIAL_DEVIATION|OUTSIDE_STANDARD|UNKNOWN
- context_tags: array from context list (may be empty)
- context_effect: STABLE_DESPITE_CONTEXT|DEGRADED_UNDER_CONTEXT|CONTEXT_REQUIRED_ASSISTANCE|INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE|NOT_APPLICABLE
- transfer_interpretation: TRUE_REGRESSION_LIKELY|CONTEXTUAL_TRANSFER_DIFFICULTY_LIKELY|AMBIGUOUS|NOT_APPLICABLE
- missing_middle_states: array of applicable states from the missing-middle list
- measurable_deviations: array of {metric, value_text, unit_or_note} only if explicitly stated
- flags: {encouraging_tone_with_deficiency: bool, high_grade_with_assistance_signal: bool, high_grade_with_inconsistency_signal: bool, narrative_silent_on_performance: bool}

Candidate dimensions:
KNOWLEDGE_UNDERSTANDING, PROCEDURAL_EXECUTION, TECHNICAL_CONTROL, ACCURACY_TOLERANCE, INDEPENDENCE, CONSISTENCY, DECISION_MAKING, SITUATIONAL_AWARENESS, WORKLOAD_MANAGEMENT, COMMUNICATION_RADIO, SOP_CHECKLIST_DISCIPLINE, TRANSFER_ADAPTABILITY, SAFETY_MARGIN, LEARNING_RESPONSE_IMPROVEMENT, INSTRUCTOR_ASSISTANCE, OTHER, UNKNOWN

Context tags:
WIND, CROSSWIND, GUSTS, TURBULENCE, TRAFFIC, ATC_WORKLOAD, HIGH_WORKLOAD, DIFFERENT_AIRPORT, UNFAMILIAR_AIRPORT, DIFFERENT_AIRCRAFT, INSTRUMENT_CONDITIONS_OR_SIMULATED_IFR, EMERGENCY_OR_ABNORMAL_SCENARIO, COMBINED_TASK, CHECK_OR_EVALUATION_ENVIRONMENT, FATIGUE_OR_HUMAN_FACTORS, OTHER, UNKNOWN

Missing-middle states:
NEEDS_CONTINUOUS_ASSISTANCE, NEEDS_OCCASIONAL_PROMPTING, INDEPENDENT_BUT_INCONSISTENT, ACCURATE_ONLY_IN_FAMILIAR_CONTEXT, INDEPENDENT_WITHIN_TOLERANCE, PERFORMS_CONSISTENTLY, TRANSFERS_TO_CHANGED_CONTEXT
